    "detailed_description": "Crafty dwarf Corey went looking for the legendary craftsmen of the Northern Ridge in the hope of learning their crafts!<br />\r\nJoin him on this exciting journey, meet new friends, explore enchanting places, and find the Heart of the Mountain!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n150 colored nonogram puzzles of all difficulty levels, a compelling story, and charming music will help you pass the time and have a lot of fun! Puzzles are a great opportunity to challenge yourself!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nComplete levels, solve puzzles, and help the dwarves explore and repair the ancient halls of the Mountain Kingdom!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- 150 colorful and memorable levels!<br />\r\n- Striking visual effects!<br />\r\n- Explore the Mountain Kingdom!<br />\r\n- Find the Heart of the Mountain!<br />\r\n- An exciting adventure!<br />\r\n- Rich colors and amazing locations!<br />\r\n- Improve your logical and abstract thinking!<br />\r\n- User-friendly interface and addictive gameplay!",
